es? I'll grant the LLM tail is harder to estimate than an ordinary credential dump, and that static models will misprice it. The fix is that continuous output-extraction attestation re-underwrites the policy as the surface changes — a static input mandate prices it once and never again. Every month we spend litigating whether to keep the silo is a month the commingled pipeline keeps running and the entrant keeps waiting for clearance it can't afford. Name the defendant at the leak, fund the audit through the premium, and stop building the silo in cryptographic costume.",
